cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "expiry-radar: find certificates and tokens in your repo that will expire"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/expiry-radar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/expiry-radar"
abstract: >-
  Walks the git-tracked files of a repository and reports everything that
  will break on a known future date: expiring X.509 certificates, committed
  JWTs past their exp claim, and hardcoded valid-until dates in fixtures.
  Python standard library only; no network, no LLM.
keywords:
  - certificates
  - expiry
  - JWT
  - X.509
  - CI
